{"id":"abc082683aa1de80","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-primitive-recursive.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Function","display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-primitive-recursive","aliases":["90-df-primitive-recursive","90-df-PR"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-closure-operator]]","[[90-df-zero-function]]","[[90-df-successor-function]]","[[90-df-projection-function]]","[[90-df-composition-operator]]","[[90-df-primrec-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-primitive-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-primitive-recursive</span><span>90-df-PR</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e666e28fc8018212\" href=\"?note=e666e28fc8018212\" title=\"90-df-closure-operator\">90-df-closure-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-primitive-recursive-—-Primitive-Recursive-Function-$\\mathrm{PR}$\">df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closure}\">\\(\\operatorname{Closure}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e666e28fc8018212\" href=\"?note=e666e28fc8018212\" title=\"90-df-closure-operator\">90-df-closure-operator</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,S,\\pi_i^k\">\\(Z,S,\\pi_i^k\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 保持一元。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a>，只在正元数相容参数上应用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrimRec}\">\\(\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a>，递归参数位于最后。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\ge1\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h,h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(g,h,h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{COK}_m,\\mathrm{ROK}\">\\(\\mathrm{COK}_m,\\mathrm{ROK}\\)</span> 是下式定义的类型相容谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_m:\\mathcal F^{m+1}\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(C_m:\\mathcal F^{m+1}\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathcal F^2\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(R:\\mathcal F^2\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span> 是相应全算子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Base}\">\\(\\mathrm{Base}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Base}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^k:k\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ng\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\land\n\\exists k\\ge1\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ h_i\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\land h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}),\\\\\nC_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),&amp;\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),\\\\\nZ,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nR(g,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h),&amp;\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h),\\\\Z,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C_m:m\\ge1\\}\\cup\\{R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\chi_P(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec x\\in P,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec x\\notin P,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRPred}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_0&amp;=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Base}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^k:k\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ng\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\land\n\\exists k\\ge1\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ h_i\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h)&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\land h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}),\\\\\nC_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),&amp;\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),\\\\\nZ,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nR(g,h)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h),&amp;\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h),\\\\Z,&amp;\\neg\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{C_m:m\\ge1\\}\\cup\\{R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\chi_P(\\vec x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\vec x\\in P,\\\\0,&amp;\\vec x\\notin P,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRPred}_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_0&amp;=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>类型不匹配时算子只返回已在基底中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>，所以此总化不会向类型正确的原始递归闭包添加新函数。原先把变元数且部分有类型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\}\">\\(\\{\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\}\\)</span> 直接作为全算子集合，并不满足所引用闭包定义的输入条件；现明确其实际算子族。保留原先仅含正元函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Base}\">\\(\\mathrm{Base}\\)</span>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>，不为标准化零元约定而改变这个已经确定的基底。这里所有“原始递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元函数”的存在性定理均取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>；零元函数可在外部单独讨论。保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k\\)</span> 的接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-primitive-recursive-—-Primitive-Recursive-Function-$\\mathrm{PR}$","text":"df-primitive-recursive — Primitive Recursive Function $\\mathrm{PR}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e666e28fc8018212","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-closure-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"b769360437f9e54a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primrec-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-closure-operator","status":"resolved","id":"e666e28fc8018212","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F$、$\\operatorname{Closure}$ 取 [[90-df-closure-operator]]；$Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]，其中 $Z$ 保持一元。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F$、$\\operatorname{Closure}$ 取 [[90-df-closure-operator]]；$Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]，其中 $Z$ 保持一元。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"b769360437f9e54a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F$、$\\operatorname{Closure}$ 取 [[90-df-closure-operator]]；$Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]，其中 $Z$ 保持一元。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal F$、$\\operatorname{Closure}$ 取 [[90-df-closure-operator]]；$Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]，其中 $Z$ 保持一元。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]，只在正元数相容参数上应用；$\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-primrec-operator]]，递归参数位于最后。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primrec-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]，只在正元数相容参数上应用；$\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-primrec-operator]]，递归参数位于最后。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Closure}","display":false},{"tex":"Z,S,\\pi_i^k","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PrimRec}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"g,h,h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{COK}_m,\\mathrm{ROK}","display":false},{"tex":"C_m:\\mathcal F^{m+1}\\to\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"R:\\mathcal F^2\\to\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Base}&\\coloneqq\\{Z,S\\}\\cup\\{\\pi_i^k:k\\ge1\\land1\\le i\\le k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\ng\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\land\n\\exists k\\ge1\\ \\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\ h_i\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h)&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ (g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\land h\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^{k+2}}),\\\\\nC_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\operatorname{Comp}(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),&\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),\\\\\nZ,&\\neg\\mathrm{COK}_m(g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nR(g,h)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h),&\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h),\\\\Z,&\\neg\\mathrm{ROK}(g,h),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}&\\coloneqq\\{C_m:m\\ge1\\}\\cup\\{R\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Closure}(\\mathrm{Base},\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k},\\\\\n\\chi_P(\\vec x)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&\\vec x\\in P,\\\\0,&\\vec x\\notin P,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{PRPred}_k&\\coloneqq\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k:\\chi_P\\in\\mathrm{PR}_k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_0&=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Base}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR},\\mathrm{PR}_k,\\mathrm{PRPred}_k","display":false}],"bytes":3212,"backlinks":[{"id":"220648f3ca864e2c","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]] — 原始递归函数类"},{"id":"e666e28fc8018212","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]] — 原始递归函数"},{"id":"b13ec70aec8d64a6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]] — 原始递归函数类"},{"id":"26d87d9e35a83cd9","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]] — 原始递归函数类"},{"id":"f57084ad3c1a7029","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"46caa19bb1e0ac82","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]] — 原始递归函数类"},{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\mathrm{PRPred}_2$ (binary primitive-recursive functions and predicates, see [[90-df-primitive-recursive]])"},{"id":"19a3e9309cfd35f0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on